1
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,620
Um...

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,000
"Experiment Result: Human is dead,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,620
mismatch."

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,460
Human is dead?

5
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:11,790
Yeah.

6
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,090
Someone...

7
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:16,800
...died?

8
00:00:17,130 --> 00:00:19,300
I think so. Probably.

9
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,340
What does it say after that?

10
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:24,850
The details are in Jellyman's Report #143.

11
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,600
Jellyman's Report?

12
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,270
What's that?

13
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,350
How should I know?

14
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:32,770
But there's a weird database on this server.

15
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:34,650
What is this?

16
00:00:34,650 --> 00:00:36,780
Some kind of program code, I think.

17
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,490
<i>An Introduction to Character Code Engineering</i><i></i>

18
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,040
I don't get it!

19
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,040
Daru-kun?

20
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,160
This doesn't make any sense!

21
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,040
Die! Damn it!

22
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,960
We should stop.

23
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:58,380
This is the first time I've had an

24
00:00:58,380 --> 00:01:00,550
"I was this close to getting it!" experience.

25
00:01:00,550 --> 00:01:01,720
Good job.

26
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:02,720
Take a break.

27
00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:04,930
You don't have to tell me. I'm done.

28
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:07,520
Daru-kun, I've got canned oden.

29
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,390
Thanks.

30
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:09,730
<i>Program code...</i>

31
00:01:10,390 --> 00:01:14,190
<i>The IBN 5100 was created before BASIC,</i>

32
00:01:14,190 --> 00:01:18,360
<i>So it can read IBN's proprietary programming languages or something...</i>

33
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:23,570
<i>I need the IBN 5100's abilities to stop their plans.</i>

34
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:26,330
<i>I'd like to talk to you in detail.</i>

35
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:28,580
<i>This is my address.</i>

36
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,580
<i>If you contact me, I'll answer.</i>

37
00:01:31,570 --> 00:01:33,030
There's something I want to ask you.

